st.ts:66-90` explicitly requires that result, and a failed `rename` can leave the publication outcome uncertain.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested status correction</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        status: 'indeterminate',\n-        detail: `ratchet: could not ensure baselines dir for '${input.ws}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n+        status: 'failed',\n+        error: `ratchet: could not ensure baselines dir for '${input.ws}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n\n-          status: 'indeterminate',\n-          detail: `ratchet: baselines dir vanished during capture — ${containment.error}`,\n+          status: 'failed',\n+          error: `ratchet: baselines dir vanished during capture — ${containment.error}`,\n\n-          status: 'indeterminate',\n-          detail: `ratchet: could not inspect existing baseline '${relPath}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n+          status: 'failed',\n+          error: `ratchet: could not inspect existing baseline '${relPath}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n\n-            status: 'indeterminate',\n-            detail: `ratchet: could not read existing baseline '${relPath}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n+            status: 'failed',\n+            error: `ratchet: could not read existing baseline '${relPath}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n\n-        status: 'indeterminate',\n-        detail: `ratchet: could not acquire the capture lock for baseline '${relPath}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n+        status: 'failed',\n+        error: `ratchet: could not acquire the capture lock for baseline '${relPath}' — ${errorMessage(err)}`,\n```\n\n</details>","id":"88521a50278089d12150a6c4e0eccbc25463d1eb66db858fad4750c7aa3b7314","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/ratchet/captureBaseline.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Return definitive pre-publication store faults as `failed`."}],"head":"45c16c8823e9a5b4b957f81980d34a61c573dddd","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"72ea719bf92bfe6c24a8b691bff41e3aa90842e1